# ── Root debris prevention (Phase 65 HYGN-03/HYGN-04) ──────────────

# ── Intentional root assets (DO NOT ignore these) ──────────────────
# Tracked root files verified as intentional (Phase 65 audit):
#   libraries.csv, ie_volume_map.json, primary_ie_map.json
#   Help.html, icon.ico, image.png, version_info.txt
#   ANTIVIRUS_INFO.txt, CompileScriptGenizah.iss
#   oxford_full_db.json, cambridge_genizah.json (tracked data files)
#   All *.py source files, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, CLAUDE.md
#   requirements.txt, ruff.toml, .gitignore
# If adding new ignore patterns, verify they don't match these files.

# Debug / scratch files (underscore-prefixed temp files)
/_*.txt
/_*.log
/_*.js
/_*.md
/_*.json

# Backup and temp files
/*.bak
/*.tmp.*
/genizah_app.py.tmp.*

